			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 790750101,
					"content": "肖維涅到底在想什麼呢？唉，他就是不願意和我說話。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕紐爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750102,
					"content": "關於肖維涅…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750103,
					"content": "您好，兩位。很抱歉…肖維涅一定是還在生我的氣，不肯出來和我說話。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕紐爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750104,
					"content": "唉…可是那底下既吹不到風，也照不到太陽，要是他枯萎了該怎麼辦啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕紐爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750105,
					"content": "那個…既然是一盆花的話…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750106,
					"content": "我們可以直接把他捧出來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750107,
					"content": "我試過了，但肖維涅一直在生悶氣，我根本沒辦法靠近他…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕紐爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750108,
					"content": "他的氣太大，我都差點被吹走了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕紐爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750109,
					"content": "等一下，為什麼生氣會把人吹跑啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750110,
						790750111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750110,
					"content": "這個氣也太大了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750112,
					"content": "也許是我之前拒絕和肖維涅一起遠行，讓他不高興了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕紐爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750113,
					"content": "#兩位客人，可以請{F#妳}{M#你}們去看看肖維涅嗎？說不定{F#妳}{M#你}們有辦法勸得動他。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕紐爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750114,
					"content": "沒問題，我們去試試看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750115,
					"content": "嗯，我們去過好多地方旅行，也見了好多人，一定…說不定真的可以勸得動他。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750116,
					"content": "#那就太好了！肖維涅就在這座島下面的洞窟裡，請{F#妳}{M#你}們去那邊找他吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕紐爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750117,
					"content": "我…我要打掃打掃這裡，幫肖維涅找一個最適合曬太陽的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "帕紐爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750111,
					"content": "的確很不想讓人靠近呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750112
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
